THEOREM C7 == WriterInit \in Writer BY DEF WriterInit, Writer, Opt
THEOREM C6 == ASSUME NEW W \in Writer PROVE W.memo \in Nat BY DEF Writer
\* The membership of one such constructor, from the types of what it reads.
THEOREM M1 ==
  ASSUME NEW s \in Writers, w \in [Writers -> Writer], doc \in [Paths -> Opt(Handles)], seq \in Nat,
         NEW taken \in SUBSET Paths, NEW q \in Paths,
         \A p \in Paths : doc[p] # Nil => Gen(doc[p]) \in Gens
  PROVE  B3W(s, taken, q) \in Writer
BY DEF B3W, Writer, Opt
\* ...and a field read through it.
THEOREM M2 ==
  ASSUME NEW s \in Writers, w \in [Writers -> Writer], NEW taken \in SUBSET Paths, NEW q \in Paths
  PROVE  B3W(s, taken, q).uploads = w[s].uploads /\ B3W(s, taken, q).pc = "consumed"
BY DEF B3W
====
